enkiTS
------------------------------------------
A permissively licensed C and C++ Task Scheduler for creating parallel
programs. Requires C++11 support.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.11-1
  libenkiTS-devel-1.12-1bl1
  libenkiTS1-1.12-1bl1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1
  pkg-config-3.0.9-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.4-1
  cygport-0.37.10-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  ninja-1.13.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/dougbinks/enkiTS

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/dougbinks/enkiTS/archive/refs/tags/v1.12.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack enkiTS-1.12-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./enkiTS-1.12-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/enkiTS-1.12-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/enkiTS-1.12-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libenkiTS1-1.12-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libenkiTS-devel-1.12-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(enkiTS)
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/enkiTS.README
  /usr/share/doc/enkiTS/README.md

(libenkiTS1)
  /usr/bin/cygenkiTS-1.dll

(libenkiTS-devel)
  /usr/include/enkiTS/LockLessMultiReadPipe.h
  /usr/include/enkiTS/TaskScheduler.h
  /usr/include/enkiTS/TaskScheduler_c.h
  /usr/lib/cmake/enkiTS/enkiTSConfig-relwithdebinfo.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/enkiTS/enkiTSConfig.cmake
  /usr/lib/libenkiTS.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/enkiTS.pc

